{
  "job_B23.3.1.6_20251003_114604": {
    "text": "\u00deonne se mone bi\u00f0 anre nihte eald, swahw\u00e6tswa \u00feu gesihst, p\u00e6te kym\u00f0 to gefean.\nOn twam nihtum & on iii, ne bi\u00f0 on \u00feam swefne ne god ne yfel.\nOn iiii & on v \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 god, wite \u00feu, \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00feinre heortan.\nOn vi nihte monan, \u00fe\u00e6t\u00f0e \u00feonne \u00f0ynce, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu geseo, sy \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6st on \u00feinum breostum, heald \u00fee georne,\nOn vii nihte monan, swahw\u00e6tswa \u00fee \u00feonne on eage gebyre\u00f0, \u00e6fter langre tide cym\u00f0 seo geendung.\nOn viii & on ix nihte, sona \u00fee \u00e6tew\u00f0, swahw\u00e6tswa \u00fee geswefna\u00f0, gif \u00feu unrotnesse geseo, wend \u00fein\nOn x nihte \u00fein swefen ag\u00e6\u00f0 butan frecednesse.\nOn xi nihte \u00fe\u00e6t swefen kym\u00f0 to geafean.\nOn twelf nihte & on xiii binnan iii nihtum \u00feu gesihst, \u00fe\u00e6t\u00f0e on swefne \u00e6teowde.\nOn xiiii nihte, nafa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t nane fremminge ne godes ne yfeles.\nOn xv nihte monan, scorte fulfremmednesse hafa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t swefen.\nOn xvi nihte monan \u00e6fter langere tide \u00fe\u00e6t swefen ag\u00e6\u00f0.\nOn xvii & on xviii & on xix \u00fe\u00e6t swefen bi\u00f0 god & on manegum dagum geenda\u00f0.\nOn xx & on xxi nihte ceapunge & hwearfunge getacna\u00f0.\nOn xxii & xxiii, seo meting bi\u00f0 geteres ful & geflites & costunge, ne bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t god swefen.\nOn xxiii nihte, \u00fe\u00e6t getacna\u00f0 gefean & h\u00e6lo.\nOn xxv & xxvi, towardlice fyrhtu & brogan \u00fe\u00e6t getacna\u00f0, & on ix dagum o\u00f0\u00f0e on x \u00fe\u00e6te bi\u00f0 \u00e6teowed,\nOn xxvii & \u00fee bi\u00f0 & on xxvii & on xxix, \u00fe\u00e6t swefen tacna\u00f0 ealne gefean, & eghwylcere angnesse &\nOn xxx nihta aldne monan, efter twegra daga fyrste \u00fe\u00e6t swefen ag\u00e6\u00f0 butan frecednesse.",
